    "detailed_description": "AviGames presents the second game from the Detective Agency &quot;Gray Tie&quot; series. This exciting game is packed with beautiful locations, diverse and interesting ways of searching for items, as well as new mini-games.<br />\r\nIn this mysterious detective story, you will help detectives find a stolen picture and solve the crime.<br />\r\nProfessional detectives Amanda and her assistant take up the case. You will arrive in France to meet the artist, Jovanni Rosen, who will ask you to find his magnum opus painting. The investigation will bring you to various secret places. You\u2019ll be chasing the robber and get very unexpected results. You will get to the black market and find some cool technical devices for criminals. Follow the culprit step by step and get caught in his clever traps. You will visit the observatory and TV studio and find out the truth about the theft.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis special Collector\u2019s Edition release is full of exclusive extras you won\u2019t find in the standard version.<br />\r\nThe Collector\u2019s Edition includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* 8 extra locations with even more things to find!<br />\r\n* 8 more mini-games to complete!<br />\r\n* Downloadable wallpapers!<br />\r\n* Listen to the soundtrack!<br />\r\n* Find interesting evidence and add them to the storage!<br />\r\n* 12 more mini-games for those who love playing them.",
